{"id":"3892a4c1e6888919","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Cat Yoneda Embedding","display":"df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding — ZFC Cat Yoneda Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding — ZFC Cat Yoneda Embedding","depends_on":["[[58-cor-yoneda-embedding]]","[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding — ZFC Cat Yoneda Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5caf5b54bcc1111e\" href=\"?note=5caf5b54bcc1111e\" title=\"58-cor-yoneda-embedding\">58-cor-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,\\mathcal C,\\eta,f,a,b,x,y,g,u,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\">\\(Y,\\mathcal C,\\eta,f,a,b,x,y,g,u,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> are the bounded Hom-set and natural-transformation-set operators defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatYonedaEmbedding}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatYonedaEmbedding}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}hom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in C_1:s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=a\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=b\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}hom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in C_1:s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=a\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=b\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformations}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\eta\\in\\prod_{x\\in C_0}\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,b)^{\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)}:{}&amp;\\\\\n\\forall x,y\\in C_0\\;\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(y,x)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)\\quad\n&amp;\\eta(y)\\bigl(c_{\\mathcal C}(\\langle g,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;=c_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(\\langle\\eta(x)(g),u\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformations}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\eta\\in\\prod_{x\\in C_0}\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,b)^{\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)}:{}&amp;\\\\\n\\forall x,y\\in C_0\\;\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(y,x)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)\\quad\n&amp;\\eta(y)\\bigl(c_{\\mathcal C}(\\langle g,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;=c_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(\\langle\\eta(x)(g),u\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S(\\eta,f,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists a,b\\in C_0\\;\\Bigl(\nf\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\land\\eta\\in\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in C_0\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)\\;\n\\eta(x)(g)=c_{\\mathcal C}(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S(\\eta,f,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists a,b\\in C_0\\;\\Bigl(\nf\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\land\\eta\\in\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in C_0\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)\\;\n\\eta(x)(g)=c_{\\mathcal C}(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatYonedaEmbedding}_S(Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\nY,C_1,\n\\bigcup_{a,b\\in C_0}\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S(Y(f),f,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in C_0\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\left(\nY\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatYonedaEmbedding}_S(Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\nY,C_1,\n\\bigcup_{a,b\\in C_0}\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S(Y(f),f,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in C_0\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\left(\nY\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The object action is the canonical assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mapsto\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,a)\">\\(a\\mapsto\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,a)\\)</span>. The natural-transformation set is bounded by an explicit dependent product and spells out naturality, so no proper class of all sets is passed to a set-coded category predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> records the arrow action <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\mapsto(g\\mapsto f\\circ g)\">\\(f\\mapsto(g\\mapsto f\\circ g)\\)</span>.  The final family of bijections is precisely full faithfulness; its surjectivity is the Yoneda lemma from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5caf5b54bcc1111e\" href=\"?note=5caf5b54bcc1111e\" title=\"58-cor-yoneda-embedding\">58-cor-yoneda-embedding</a>.</li>\n<li>The main predicate existentially unpacks every category component. The arrow action is represented by the total set function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1\">\\(C_1\\)</span> and the fully data-parameterized relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S\\)</span>; no hidden component or purported total operator on all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> remains.</li>\n<li>The former version cited an undeclared <code>YonedaEmbeddingFullyFaithful</code> predicate that the corollary never introduced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-cor-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"5caf5b54bcc1111e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-cor-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]], [[58-df-bijective]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]], [[58-df-bijective]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-cor-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"5caf5b54bcc1111e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$Y$ records the arrow action $f\\mapsto(g\\mapsto f\\circ g)$.  The final family of bijections is precisely full faithfulness; its surjectivity is the Yoneda lemma from [[58-cor-yoneda-embedding]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Y,\\mathcal C,\\eta,f,a,b,x,y,g,u,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatYonedaEmbedding}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}hom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in C_1:s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=a\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=b\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformations}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\eta\\in\\prod_{x\\in C_0}\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,b)^{\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)}:{}&\\\\\n\\forall x,y\\in C_0\\;\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(y,x)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)\\quad\n&\\eta(y)\\bigl(c_{\\mathcal C}(\\langle g,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&=c_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(\\langle\\eta(x)(g),u\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S(\\eta,f,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists a,b\\in C_0\\;\\Bigl(\nf\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\land\\eta\\in\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in C_0\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(x,a)\\;\n\\eta(x)(g)=c_{\\mathcal C}(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatYonedaEmbedding}_S(Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\nY,C_1,\n\\bigcup_{a,b\\in C_0}\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S(Y(f),f,C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in C_0\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\left(\nY\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{NatRep}_{C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C}}(a,b)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"a\\mapsto\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,a)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"f\\mapsto(g\\mapsto f\\circ g)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YonedaArrowData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":4330,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1570","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding.md|58-df-zfc-cat-yoneda-embedding]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["5caf5b54bcc1111e","a87b7e1119b63b2c","36d7463d215be751","d583890235faf0d5"]}